					},
					"text": {
						"type": "text",
						"value": "CENTER\n\nThe Center node outputs the center of the incoming slices as a float2 (x\/y).\n\nIn this example we use the center node to draw a small dot in the center of each slice. Which could be handy when videomapping. Using Booleans we allow the user to show\/hide both the dots and slices."
					}
				},
